@startuml
title SEQ-14 - Owner-scoped guided lesson (DEV)
actor Learner
participant Web
participant "GotIt Backend" as Backend
participant "rbase Core" as Core
database "product_gotit" as DB
participant "AI / Realtime provider" as AI
Learner -> Web : Choose actual unit / personal course and mode
Web -> Backend : Create lesson with context
Backend -> Core : Verify identity / access / actual minute balance
Backend -> DB : Resolve owned context and reserve lesson
Backend -> DB : Create bounded activity and revision
Backend -> AI : Issue bounded Realtime session (guided VAD does not auto-answer)
Backend --> Web : Server activity + one-use connection ticket
loop Answer / hint / continue / review
 Web -> Backend : UUID + expected revision + strict command
 Backend -> DB : Owner / active / deadline / replay check
 alt Duplicate UUID, same fingerprint
  DB --> Backend : Original snapshot receipt
 else New command
  Backend -> AI : Bounded untrusted answer evaluation
  Backend -> DB : Transactional active-deadline CAS + receipt
 end
 Backend --> Web : Server snapshot and selected tutor event
end
Web -> Backend : Complete lesson
Backend -> AI : Structured report from bounded server turns
alt Valid report
 Backend -> DB : Atomic report persistence + temporary activity/receipt purge
 Backend --> Web : Actual report / follow-up homework
else Report generation failure
 Backend --> Web : Retryable failure, no fabricated saved evidence
end
note over Web,Backend : Text requires no microphone. Pause does not stop billing.
note over DB,AI : No learner audio file stored; fixed public teacher samples are separate.
@enduml
